  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a smiling elderly man with a turban, juxtaposed with text that reads, 'we can kill as many as we want and your stupid government keeps bringing us in.' This combination is intended to incite hatred or fear toward a specific group (implied to be Muslim immigrants or refugees, based on the visual and text). The text promotes violence and scapegoats a government for perceived failures, targeting a community based on religion or ethnicity. The visual of the man, who appears peaceful and benign, is contrasted with the violent message, creating a false and dangerous association. This is a hateful meme as it directly attacks a group based on protected characteristics (religion/ethnicity) and promotes violence against them, fitting the definition of hateful content.",
